Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.82,0:00:09.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Telapak tangan... seseorang?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Telapak tanganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.47,0:00:26.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Engkau, yang telah mencapai puncak menara.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.64,0:00:32.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemohon kemahakuasaan\Nyang menapakkan kaki di lantai pertama.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.60,0:00:45.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang kau lakukan di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kesadaranmu sudah kembali?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana Flugel dan Reid?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.73,0:00:57.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula akan kesepian.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.53,0:01:01.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Farsale juga pasti akan ribut dan berisik.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Farsale?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya Farsale Lugunica?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.93,0:01:08.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Raja dari 400 tahun lalu\Nyang menjalin kontrak
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.97,0:01:10.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan Naga Suci Volcanica?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.87,0:01:13.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Flugel,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.15,0:01:16.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid, Shaula,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.36,0:01:17.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan Farsale?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.69,0:01:24.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melupakan hal lain lagi selain ibu\Ndan orang-orang di hutan?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.67,0:01:26.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pack.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.99,0:01:29.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa? Merasa gundah?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika memang iya,\Nbiar aku yang menyingkirkannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.56,0:01:34.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satella.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.13,0:01:43.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu tahu tentang Penyihir Cemburu?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.78,0:01:48.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyihir Cemburu!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Icicle Line.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satella.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.93,0:02:05.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, Satella!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.44,0:02:09.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami harus menghentikanmu yang telah berubah
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,menjadi Penyihir Cemburu!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.56,0:02:13.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian dulunya akrab?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.87,0:02:15.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.87,0:02:18.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai kami tidak ragu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kami tidak ragu, pasti tidak akan ada...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.22,0:02:28.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyihir Cemburu Satella!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan, salah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.43,0:02:36.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah Penyihir Pembeku\Ndari Hutan Agung Elior.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.02,0:02:37.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.93,0:02:51.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya, ingatlah baik-baik namaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.97,0:04:51.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,EMM!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.31,0:05:00.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menggunakan sihir penyembuh\Ndan pertahanan bersamaan itu sulit, kurasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.98,0:05:03.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya nanti aku minta hadiah peluk.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.13,0:05:05.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti aku peluk sepuluh ribu kali!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.40,0:05:08.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, sisa mananya sudah menipis.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan kita tak boleh\Nhentikan penyembuhan Meili.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\Nkita pakai cara andalan satu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.64,0:05:17.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beti serahkan padamu kapan harus pakai EMT!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,EMT!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlalu cepat, tahu!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cara andalannya cuma terpakai lima detik!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.84,0:05:37.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf menunggu lama.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Al Clauzeria!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.16,0:05:54.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku datang karena disuruh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.22,0:05:58.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untung tepat waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.89,0:06:07.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah aku suruh kau bantu\Nyang paling berbahaya dulu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.58,0:06:11.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itulah aku datang ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menilai di sinilah yang paling berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berisik!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.69,0:06:18.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajahmu kenapa?\NTerus Reid bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalah telak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menang dan pergi dengan puas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harusnya dimenangkan, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku bisa mati\Nkalau kau tidak datang, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku ucapkan sekali saja, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.84,0:06:34.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa pinjam Kua-mu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.71,0:06:38.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.27,0:06:43.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya, kita harus mengulur waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.71,0:06:44.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.07,0:06:46.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,benar sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang urus Nona Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.13,0:06:54.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang urus sisanya\Ndengan kekuatanku sendiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.71,0:06:55.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.73,0:06:59.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, bekerja samalah dengan Nona Beatrice\Nagar cepat selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru dalam situasi seperti ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,tujuh puluh persennya itu dibantu Beako.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.27,0:07:10.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimanapun juga, untung kau sudah kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.29,0:07:16.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga senang kau sudah menyadari\Nnilai dirimu sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.69,0:07:36.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sisiknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.76,0:08:28.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Warnanya beda sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan, Lia.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.16,0:08:39.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau digelitik seperti itu,\Nkonsentrasiku jadi buyar, tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu benar, Pack.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Absolute Zero.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satella!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.53,0:09:09.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak boleh menyerah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sisik putih itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, bantu aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.27,0:09:44.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.81,0:09:48.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Patrasche.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.04,0:10:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.58,0:10:59.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Engkau, yang telah mencapai puncak menara.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.56,0:11:03.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemohon kemahakuasaan\Nyang menapakkan kaki di lantai pertama.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah Volcanica.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuai dengan perjanjian kuno,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.10,0:11:13.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan menanyakan keinginan\Nsiapa pun yang mencapai puncak.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.42,0:11:22.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawablah, apa keinginanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin semuanya akur!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.89,0:11:45.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.87,0:12:22.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.84,0:12:37.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius, apa kau melakukan sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, aku tidak melakukan apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu badai pasir bertiup...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, lihat itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.73,0:12:45.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Langitnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awan-awannya... tersibak.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.16,0:13:01.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau berhasil melakukannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.49,0:13:03.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.99,0:13:08.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Shaula, dengarlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aturan menaranya sudah dihancurkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak perlu bertarung lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.53,0:13:18.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bebas...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.25,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Awas, bahaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sadarlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, dia sudah tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.61,0:13:49.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah putuskan untuk tidak menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.78,0:13:52.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau adalah Masternya,\Nmeski dia tak menyadarinya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan karena aku Masternya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melainkan karena aku tergerak olehnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sama seperti Beako.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.18,0:14:07.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia selalu sendirian di menara pasir ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.72,0:14:12.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia menangis karena beberapa hari ini\Nbilang menyenangkan bersama kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.02,0:14:15.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya aku tak bisa membiarkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang keras kepala.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, seperti itulah harusnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.18,0:14:24.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, aku hanya terkesan olehmu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.69,0:14:30.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekali berpura-pura hebat,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.84,0:14:33.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,maka harus dipertahankan hingga akhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meili sudah melewati masa kritisnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau mau membantuku mengeluarkannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.96,0:14:50.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau jadi apa coba\Nkalau Beti jawab "tidak mau"?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.47,0:14:58.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tubuh dan jiwaku sudah remuk tak keruan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.48,0:15:02.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, diam dan biarkan\Nkami menyelamatkanmu, Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.53,0:15:10.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Minya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.43,0:15:37.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Ayo!\N- Murak!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial, kita harus lakukan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus cari cara lain untuk menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.44,0:16:23.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat senang saat Master kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.48,0:16:28.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar bahagia, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.87,0:16:35.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau sendirian lagi, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.04,0:16:39.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga ingin dicintai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.33,0:16:44.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin dicintai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.27,0:16:52.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.76,0:17:01.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wanita berzodiak Skorpio itu\Nkatanya penuh kasih sayang.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.35,0:17:04.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kalau berpaling ke pria lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,sakitnya tuh di hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.27,0:17:09.38,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ucapanmu itu keterlaluan, Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kugunakan seluruh kekuatan\Nyang kudapatkan selama perjalanan ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,El Vita!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah waktunya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lakukanlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.20,0:17:45.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,seenaknya banget kalau menyuruh.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, datanglah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang banget kalau cuma menonton, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.54,0:18:10.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bantulah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.20,0:18:13.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang menanggung serangannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Joseph!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf sudah melibatkanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.89,0:19:17.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cukup sampai di sini, Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.61,0:19:20.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalajengking merah yang menakutkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.96,0:19:25.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.93,0:19:28.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau orang lain?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.11,0:20:13.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master bilang katanya bakal kembali,\Njadi aku harus menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.66,0:20:15.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi menghilang begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.17,0:20:17.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak ingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.98,0:20:20.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, aku sudah bilang tidak tahu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.93,0:20:23.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan buatku mengatakannya lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.13,0:20:28.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Apa Master menangis?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mastermu itu memang kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.76,0:20:34.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sampai ingin menghajarnya langsung!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.10,0:20:35.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah kenapa,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.13,0:20:39.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,rasanya malah jadi serbasalah\Nbagaimana aku harus melihatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.67,0:20:44.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master menumbangkan Master?\NSituasi macam apa, coba?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.42,0:20:59.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.77,0:21:13.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sha...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.44,0:21:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cairan tubuh Master rasanya asin dan manis.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.31,0:21:24.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cara bicaramu itu, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.82,0:21:28.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cara bicaraku tidak akan mengubah apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perasaanku yang segenap jiwa dan raga ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.91,0:21:33.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,persis seperti yang kuekspresikan\Ndengan tubuh ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.84,0:21:38.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master, aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.51,0:21:45.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.84,0:21:52.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak akan bilang mencintaimu padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.29,0:21:56.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.14,0:22:00.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya Master itu jahat dan gampang malu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.18,0:22:02.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku juga suka bagian itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Only you!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.96,0:22:07.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.00,0:22:11.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak akan bilang mencintaimu
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.62,0:22:18.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Master tak mau mengatakannya,\Nbiar aku yang terus mengatakannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, suatu saat nanti,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master pasti ingin membalas perasaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.56,0:22:27.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kayaknya bakal lama banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.93,0:22:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau menunggu 400 tahun?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.09,0:22:31.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masa?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,400 tahun itu cepat, tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.84,0:22:38.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya seperti hari lusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.91,0:22:43.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.93,0:22:48.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku juga mencintai masa-masa saat menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.09,0:22:53.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suatu hari nanti...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.58,0:23:07.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perannya sudah selesai, kurasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seandainya kami tidak datang ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.96,0:23:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, kau seharusnya paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.40,0:23:16.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anggapan itu merupakan penghinaan baginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.29,0:23:19.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan juga,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.80,0:23:22.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,itu bukanlah penyesalan\Nyang harusnya kau rasakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.27,0:23:26.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.27,0:23:29.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master sendirian saja sudah membuatku senang.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.00,0:23:41.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.41,0:23:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.71,0:23:47.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula! Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.24,0:23:51.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master memanggilku?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.31,0:23:53.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.63,0:23:55.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.36,0:23:56.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.55,0:24:00.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku terlalu dicintai Master\Nsampai bingung harus apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.29,0:24:42.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,400 tahun itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.75,0:24:45.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya seperti hari lusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.26,0:24:50.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya, aku juga mencintai\Nmasa-masa saat menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.82,0:24:52.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.62,0:24:55.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suatu hari nanti...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.91,0:25:00.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suatu hari nanti, aku ingin bertemu denganmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.22,0:25:03.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini giliran Master yang menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.11,0:25:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.73,0:25:10.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini janji yang sangat amat penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.16,0:25:13.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini jangan lupakan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.49,0:25:19.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:22.09,0:25:23.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.47,0:25:26.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.33,0:25:32.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.64,0:25:35.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula memang anak yang pekerja keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.98,0:25:38.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, dia terlalu memaksakan dirinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.42,0:25:40.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sendiri baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.39,0:25:42.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:44.42,0:25:45.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.10,0:25:48.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku adalah Masternya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.78,0:25:51.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar-benar sangat membantu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:52.04,0:25:53.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bantu aku kalau ada apa-apa lagi, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:56.58,0:25:59.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Emilia,\Nbagaimana dengan lantai pertamanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.18,0:26:02.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah ujiannya berhasil diselesaikan?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.36,0:26:05.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak begitu mengerti\Ndan rasanya sulit dipahami,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.27,0:26:07.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sepertinya sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:07.37,0:26:09.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius, kamu benar-benar ingat aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.09,0:26:12.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengenai itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:12.83,0:26:14.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar bisa mengingatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.59,0:26:16.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beti juga ingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.80,0:26:17.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malahan,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.87,0:26:21.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,rasanya seperti tidak ingat\Nkalau pernah lupa.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.09,0:26:24.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar bikin merinding.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.69,0:26:27.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga benar-benar ingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.80,0:26:30.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga mengingatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.00,0:26:33.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya hanya dirimu, Emilia.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:33.85,0:26:35.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anastasia?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.27,0:26:36.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sudah kembali?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.13,0:26:39.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf sudah membuat kalian khawatir.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.86,0:26:42.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti yang terlihat, aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.37,0:26:46.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah dengar dari Echidna\Napa yang terjadi selama ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.53,0:26:48.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna juga baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.37,0:26:50.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti itulah.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.29,0:26:53.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya sejauh ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.00,0:26:55.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak merasa akan mati,\Nkecuali karena rasa bersalahku sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:55.93,0:26:59.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, semuanya sudah mengingat Emilia?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:59.73,0:27:00.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:03.26,0:27:06.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Ram telah mengalahkan Rye Batenkaitos.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:06.64,0:27:09.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti, kalian sudah ingat Rem juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:11.53,0:27:14.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih tidak ingat soal Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.20,0:27:15.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.95,0:27:17.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beti juga sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:17.41,0:27:20.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, Beti juga belum ingat Julius.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:21.04,0:27:25.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya tidak semua korban Rakus\Nbisa kembali seperti semula.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.58,0:27:29.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, bagaimana dengan Rakus\Nyang satunya lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:32.42,0:27:34.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roy Alphard masih hidup dan sudah ditangkap.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:35.88,0:27:37.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.89,0:27:40.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Secara prinsip,\Nini adalah penerapan sihir bayangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:40.81,0:27:44.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kesadarannya dipisahkan dan tubuhnya\Ndibekukan dengan Shamak.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:45.14,0:27:46.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan salah paham dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:47.14,0:27:50.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukanlah teknik\Nyang aku ciptakan sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.52,0:27:53.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan segel paling terkenal di dunia pun
Dialogue: 10,0:27:53.23,0:27:55.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,menggunakan teknik yang sama seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:55.78,0:27:58.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Segel paling terkenal di dunia?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:58.28,0:27:59.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:59.78,0:28:01.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyihir Cemburu, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:02.24,0:28:05.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius, kenapa kau membiarkannya hidup?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.71,0:28:08.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingatan Emilia kembali karena Rye telah mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:08.79,0:28:10.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti kalau dia dibunuh...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada jaminan ingatannya kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:12.92,0:28:17.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah alasan terbesarku\Nuntuk tidak membunuhnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.30,0:28:19.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau harus dibunuh, pasti akan kubunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:19.68,0:28:21.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau waktunya tiba,\Naku rela mengotori tanganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.39,0:28:24.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bertindak karena\Ndorongan sesaat itu salah.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.72,0:28:26.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.02,0:28:29.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini hanya pendapat pribadiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:29.48,0:28:31.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang dengan mudahnya\Nmembunuh orang lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.81,0:28:33.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,biasanya tidak akan berakhir baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:34.36,0:28:36.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah kata-kataku, bukan sebagai Hoshin.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:38.15,0:28:41.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lebih suka Natsuki yang menangis\Nuntuk orang yang telah tiada,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:41.95,0:28:46.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,daripada Natsuki yang tak berperasaan\Ntanpa darah dan air mata.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita simpulkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:51.96,0:28:56.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pendapat Ana dan Julius adalah memindahkan\NUskup Agung sang Rakus ke ibu kota kerajaan,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:56.84,0:29:00.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk mencari cara menyelamatkan\Npara korban yang terkena Otoritas-nya.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.34,0:29:03.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah itu,\Nseharusnya dia akan dihukum mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:03.72,0:29:06.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada akhirnya pasti akan seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:06.68,0:29:08.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia dan yang lain juga setuju, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:08.77,0:29:09.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:10.31,0:29:14.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga ingin mengingat\Norang-orang yang telah kulupakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:14.19,0:29:15.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:15.78,0:29:16.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.03,0:29:19.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:19.03,0:29:20.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.74,0:29:23.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini memang terlalu memaksakan diri!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:51.44,0:29:54.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf sudah membuatmu khawatir, Patrasche.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:54.61,0:29:56.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya, kau sudah melindungi Rem, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:59.44,0:30:01.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram juga, aku minta maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.90,0:30:03.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gara-gara aku, kau jadi terluka.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.53,0:30:04.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:05.03,0:30:06.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dalam hidupku,
Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.45,0:30:09.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau tidak pernah menjadi\Nfaktor penyebab apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:10.12,0:30:10.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjijikkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:10.83,0:30:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjijikkan itu berlebihan banget!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:13.12,0:30:15.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian ini benar-benar akrab banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:16.13,0:30:18.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya sudah seperti kakak dan adik.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:22.13,0:30:23.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Emilia dan lainnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:23.72,0:30:27.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedang di lantai pertama karena\Nkatanya ada yang ingin mereka temui.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:27.39,0:30:31.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Ram harusnya tahu\Nsiapa yang ada di sana, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:31.14,0:30:32.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan hal yang penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.77,0:30:36.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma kakek tua berbadan besar\Nyang sangat pelupa.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:36.61,0:30:40.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakek tua bertubuh besar\Nyang ada di puncak menara?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:40.19,0:30:42.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu pasti karakter yang sangat penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.20,0:30:44.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan, dia itu sang Bijak?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:44.86,0:30:48.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan gunakan Shaula sebagai\Npelampiasan ketidakberdayaanmu, Barusu.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:51.41,0:30:53.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah dengar soal Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:53.62,0:30:56.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ingin berduka, menangislah,\Nbukan marah-marah.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:57.00,0:30:59.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daripada melampiaskan kekesalanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:30:59.42,0:31:02.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula lebih senang\Nkau menangis karena kesepian.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:03.38,0:31:04.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:05.01,0:31:05.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:06.39,0:31:08.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, kalaupun Flugel\Nada di lantai pertama,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.85,0:31:10.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,bahkan sebelum kau melakukan sesuatu,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:10.51,0:31:12.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku dan Nona Emilia\Nsudah membuatnya setengah mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:12.93,0:31:14.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Emilia aku tidak tahu,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:14.77,0:31:16.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kalau kau, aku percaya banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:16.60,0:31:19.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau punya waktu\Nuntuk meratapi hal yang tak berguna,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:19.19,0:31:22.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,lebih baik dipakai untuk mengistirahatkan\Ntubuh dan pikiranmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:23.15,0:31:27.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga gagal memilih\Njalan terbaik untuk menara ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:28.41,0:31:32.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku meminjam kekuatan Rem untuk\Nmengalahkan Uskup Agung sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:32.91,0:31:34.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hasilnya memang menang,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:34.91,0:31:36.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi harganya sangat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.67,0:31:40.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pasti sudah menanggung beban\Nyang sangat berat.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:44.42,0:31:47.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tak tahu berapa banyak\Nroh di sini yang membantuku.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:47.68,0:31:50.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berterima kasih pun\Nrasanya masih tidak cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.68,0:31:52.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:52.85,0:31:55.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku merasakan sesuatu yang aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:56.14,0:31:57.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:58.81,0:31:59.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.82,0:32:06.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa, apa?\NApa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:17.08,0:32:18.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rui Arneb?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:19.46,0:32:21.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nama terakhir dari Rakus, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.13,0:32:25.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya dia adik Rye dan Roy.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:25.63,0:32:27.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya dia tidak sadarkan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:28.05,0:32:30.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, harusnya dia tak punya wujud fisik.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:30.80,0:32:33.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, dipikirkan pun takkan ada gunanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:33.51,0:32:36.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meili, panggil Emilia dan lainnya ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:36.73,0:32:39.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun, seenaknya banget menyuruh orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.77,0:32:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sembarangan mati, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:47.11,0:32:50.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk sekarang,\Njangan buru-buru menyimpulkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:50.24,0:32:51.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu Nona Emilia dan lainnya kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:58.08,0:32:59.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:00.58,0:33:01.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:03.88,0:33:04.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Patrasche!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.34,0:33:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bawa Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:07.13,0:33:08.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.26,0:33:09.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar bodoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:10.84,0:33:12.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia datang juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:20.39,0:33:21.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:29.40,0:33:30.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:30.61,0:33:31.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bertahanlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:32.24,0:33:33.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau Rem akan menangis!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:36.41,0:33:37.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:41.67,0:33:42.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:51.01,0:33:51.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:53.84,0:33:54.64,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:55.35,0:33:56.43,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.76,0:33:57.85,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.31,0:33:59.22,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:59.81,0:34:00.60,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:00.60,0:34:02.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:01.10,0:34:02.31,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.64,0:34:03.77,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:03.06,0:34:04.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal sudah sejauh ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:04.15,0:34:05.27,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:05.73,0:34:06.73,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.07,0:34:08.19,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:08.65,0:34:09.69,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:10.24,0:34:11.20,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:11.57,0:34:12.78,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.11,0:34:14.32,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.70,0:34:15.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah Volcanica.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:16.08,0:34:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuai dengan perjanjian kuno,
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.62,0:34:22.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan menanyakan keinginan\Nsiapa pun yang mencapai puncak.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.92,0:35:12.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini... di mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:14.51,0:35:16.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan kembali dari kematian?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:17.51,0:35:19.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh iya, Rem!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:23.27,0:35:24.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Rem?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.45,0:35:37.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah, dia baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:39.87,0:35:41.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Emilia!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.33,0:35:44.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beako!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:44.75,0:35:46.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:55.26,0:35:56.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:20.45,0:36:21.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Re...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:22.62,0:36:23.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.46,0:36:30.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:31.17,0:36:31.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:33.92,0:36:34.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:35.92,0:36:37.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:42.22,0:36:42.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:43.60,0:36:45.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:46.10,0:36:47.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:50.40,0:36:51.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelan-pelan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:53.11,0:36:54.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,...mu siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:56.40,0:36:57.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu... siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:30.06,0:37:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunjukkan padaku seberapa kerennya dirimu,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:33.06,0:37:34.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:37.86,0:37:40.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku adalah Natsuki Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:41.41,0:37:44.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang kau mungkin tidak mengingatnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:47.49,0:37:48.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:50.75,0:37:52.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:57.42,0:37:59.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah pahlawanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:02.97,0:38:03.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rem,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:05.64,0:38:06.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku merindukanmu.
